Slide 1 — COVER
Title: AtlasOS
Subtitle: Autonomous AI Operating System for On‑Chain Finance
Tagline: Non‑custodial, auditable automation — optimized for HashKey Chain
Date: 2026-06-30
Contact: emotionalcoders@gmail.com
Website: https://atlas-os-defi-ai-haskey.lovable.app/

Speaker notes:
One-line intro: AtlasOS runs autonomous, auditable AI agents to manage risk, yield, liquidations and treasury operations on-chain. Today I'll walk through the problem, our solution, architecture, AI design and GTM.

---

Slide 2 — EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
Bullets:
- What AtlasOS is: AI agent network + policy engine + on-chain enforcement
- Problem: DeFi ops are manual, 24/7, and risky — treasury & protocol teams need automation
- Solution: Composable agents for risk, yield, liquidations, treasury with governance-first controls
- Vision: The AI OS for on-chain finance — enterprise-grade, auditable, extensible

Speaker notes:
Summarize mission and immediate value proposition. Stress non-custodial and auditable nature.

---

Slide 3 — PROBLEM STATEMENT
Bullets:
- Constant monitoring required (risk, liquidations, yield shifts)
- Manual scripts & teams are slow and error-prone
- Institutional treasuries need compliance & auditability
- Existing bots are single-purpose and brittle

Speaker notes:
Use an example: a leveraged position that could be rescued if monitored 24/7; manual teams miss windows leading to avoidable losses.

---

Slide 4 — SOLUTION OVERVIEW
Bullets:
- Off-chain AI agents propose actions; on-chain smart contracts enforce policies
- Agent types: Risk Manager, Yield Optimizer, Liquidation Agent, Treasury Manager
- Governance & multisig for high-impact actions; capability tokens for delegated actions

Speaker notes:
Explain the separation of concerns: agents propose, contracts enforce. This enables automation while preserving custody and governance.

---

Slide 5 — VISION & MISSION
Bullets:
- Long-term: Platform pleatform where protocols and treasuries plug in policies and capital
- Build marketplace for agents and strategies
- Provide enterprise SLAs and auditability to accelerate institutional DeFi adoption

Speaker notes:
Paint a picture of the ecosystem: third-party agents, audited strategies, enterprise pilots.

